# 统一换行，避免 Windows/Linux 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# index.csv 由 csv 模块写出（UTF-8 BOM + CRLF），Excel 才能直接双击打开
*.csv text eol=crlf

# 启动.bat 是 GBK(cp936) + CRLF 编码的批处理文件，
# 一旦被当作文本做换行转换就会解析失败，必须原样保留。
*.bat binary

# 二进制资源，不做任何转换
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.hwp binary
*.entpage binary
*.bak binary
*.zip binary
